:''This article is about the Cat Unit. For the enemy, see [[Iron Claw X (Enemy)]].''
'''Kung Fu Cat X''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked when beating any stage in [[Old Guys About Town (Monthly Event)|Old Guys About Town]]. He was added in [[Version 2.5 Update|Version 2.5]]. He is a Single Target variant of [[Kung Fu Cat (Special Cat)|Kung Fu Cat]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 5.3 Update|Version 5.3]] grants [[Immune to Weaken|Immunity to Weaken]] and [[Immune to Warp|Warp]], increases attack power and reduces time between attacks. In [[The Battle Cats POP!]], he is unlocked in the [[Cat Capsule|Rare Cat Capsule]] after clearing [[Moon (Empire of Cats)|Stage 48]] in Chapter 2.

