==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Drunken Master Cat X''' at level 10.

Evolves into '''Iron Claw X''' when obtained from the [[Kung-Fu X Awakens!]] (may be dropped on the first stage but guaranteed on the second stage) and is level 20 or above.

==Strategy/Usage==
The [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare]] equivalent of [[Lesser Demon Cat (Uber Rare Cat)|Lesser Demon Cat]], Kung Fu Cat X has destructive attack power at the cost of having Single Attack. He is most useful against powerful, tanky enemies like [[THE SLOTH]], [[Dark Emperor Nyandam|Nyandam]] variants, or the [[Crazed Cats (origin)|Crazed Cats]], provided he is backed up by support that can eliminate peons in his way.

He is particularly useful for finishing off the [[Gory|Gories]] that appear as support in [[Tiny Fists (Deadly)|Tiny Fists]]. Since a level 30 [[Miyamoku Musashi (Special Cat)|Heroic Musashi]] cannot instantly kill them, Iron Claw X can be used to finish them off, as he does have enough health to tank one [[Wave Attack]], allowing a wide window of opportunity.

Other than that, however, Iron Claw X doesn't see much use, as [[Kung Fu Cat (Special Cat)|Dancer Cat]]'s access to [[Talents]], Area Attack, higher range and no Warp Immunity all help to remedy his weaknesses and will completely outclass Iron Claw X.

