==Trivia==
*Kung Fu Cat X was called "''abc04542"'' on the English version 2.0.1 update due to [[PONOS Corporation|PONOS]] not changing his placeholder name. However, this bug was fixed on the 2.1.0 update.
*The Combo [[Treasured Grandchild (Combo)|Treasured Grandchild]] suggests that Kung Fu Cat X is the father of [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Titan Cat]], since [[Baby Cat (Uber Rare Cat)|Baby Cat]] is the son of Titan Cat.
*Iron Claw X's armor bears heavy resemblance to that of Fist of the North Star character [[wikipedia:Raoh|Raoh]]'s.
*In Iron Claw X's Japanese description, "Tsuyoshi's fist" is a reference to [[wikipedia:Chitō-ryū#Founder|Tsuyoshi Chitose]], the founder of the Chitō-ryū kung fu style.
*Iron Claw X was among the units that were given [[Immune to Warp]] in [[Version 6.5 Update|Version 6.5]].

